\ Strict (interpreter-free) variant of aot_user_virtual.1z. The virtual
\ generator's wrap, unwrap, predicate, and hash words must AOT-compile
\ with no interpreter fallback. Every TypeValue push routes through the
\ runtime-image slot table.

weight: virtual{ fixnum } ;

42 make-weight unmake-weight .
7 >weight unmake-weight .
13 make-weight weight? .
"not-a-weight" weight? .
100 make-weight unmake-weight >weight unmake-weight .
